      "title": "‘We will not be intimidated,’ says Estonian PM after attributing recent arson attack to Russia – as it happened",
      "link": "https://www.theguardian.com/world/live/2026/sep/29/ukraine-russia-war-odesa-overnight-lithuania-mark-rutte-europe-latest-news-updates",
      "description": "<p>Kristen Michal says attack ‘against Milrem Robotics was ordered by Russian special services’, after Kremlin denies involvement</p><p><strong>Rutte begins by recalling a drone shot down in Lithuanian airspace by Nato fighter jets two weeks ago.</strong></p><p>He says “the repeated drone incidents along our eastern flank showed the evolving nature of the threat, and we are strengthening our integrated air and missile defence.”</p><p><em>“We are adapting and reinforcing our posture against drones.”</em></p> <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/world/live/2026/sep/29/ukraine-russia-war-odesa-overnight-lithuania-mark-rutte-europe-latest-news-updates\">Continue reading...</a>",
